 "open_questions": [
  "28V net class (0.4 mm traces) and LOAD class (0.25 mm) are estimates, not checked against a current-capacity source; +28V is a whole inner plane.",
  "SS36 input diode is rated 3 A; every valve and heater on at once draws about 5.8 A (estimate from the blocks' coil and heater currents).",
  "SMBJ28A stand-off voltage equals the 28 V bus: a bus above 28 V leaks through it.",
  "DRV81008 clamp energy per valve turn-off is unchecked: the valve coil's inductance is unknown.",
  "Valve coils, heaters and their currents are placeholders until a thruster is chosen; the Aether has no 28 V bus yet."
 ]
